# Wave W17-Z (Lake Insight): calm sand — the shore path’s packed sand-snow, design-authorised: a pale cool sand-snow running the frozen lake’s shore from the long road to Rimefall’s gate, kept near the ground’s own calm so the ice carries the colour (design: the shore path at the honest-ice crossing, the warden’s posts at its end). Split from Route 217’s bench sand behind it by coolth entire and from Lake Gallant’s shore sand by season: this sand borders ice, that one open water.
